        </div>
        <div class="alignment">
            <p class="gb-paragraph"><b>Security Update 2003-08-14</b></p>
        </div>
        <div class="alignment">
            <ul role="list" class="list gb-list">
                <li role="listitem" class="gb-list_item"><p class="gb-paragraph"><b>fb_realpath(): Addresses CAN-2003-0466</b>, a potential vulnerability in the fb_realpath() function, which could allow a local or remote user to gain unauthorized root privileges to a system.</p></li>
                <li role="listitem" class="gb-list_item"><p class="gb-paragraph"><b>Workgroup Manager: Fixes CAN-2003-0601</b> to improve the security of your system by assigning a &quot;disabled&quot; password to a new account.</p></li>
                <!-- bare candidate-number lines: bold CAN id + plain title -->
                <li role="listitem" class="gb-list_item"><p class="gb-paragraph"><b>CAN-2002-1383:</b> Multiple Integer Overflows</p></li>
                <li role="listitem" class="gb-list_item"><p class="gb-paragraph"><b>CAN-2002-1366:</b> /etc/cups/certs/ Race Condition</p></li>
